message: 'To cite package "rafe" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'rafe: Decision-Aligned Forecast Evaluation and Moment Correction'
version: 0.1.0
abstract: Evaluates return forecasts by the economic damage their errors cause, rather
  than by their size. Implements the risk-adjusted forecast error (RAFE), the operator-norm
  covariance forecast error (C-RAFE), and their combination into an upper bound on
  the Sharpe-ratio gap of a plug-in mean-variance portfolio (T-RAFE), together with
  moment-correction estimators acting on the two channels of that bound.
